  "prefLabel": "Cor 503.02 Treatment Limitations",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Cor 503.02 Treatment Limitations. The authorization to provide emergency treatment to the resident shall immediately expire if a guardian over the person of the resident with authority to make treatment decisions is appointed during the period of emergency treatment authorized.\n\nSource. (See Revision Note at chapter heading for Cor 500) #12793, eff 5-25-19",
